          %h2#definition Definition
          %p
            This definition is a modified version of the one given in
            %a{:href => "#AragonEtAl97"} Aragón, Aragón, Rodríguez (1997)
          %p
            Given a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/commutative+ring"} commutative ring
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi R
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} R
            %strong geometric algebra
            is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/N-graded+module"}
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                %semantics
