          %h2#references References
          %p On the definition of geometric algebras
          %ul
            %li#AragonEtAl97
              G. Aragón, J.L. Aragón, M.A. Rodríguez (1997), Clifford Algebras and Geometric Algebra,
              %em Advances in Applied Clifford Algebras
              Vol. 7 No. 2, pg 91–102, doi:10.1007/BF03041220, S2CID:120860757
          %p The original account:
          %ul
            %li#Hestenes66
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/David+Hestenes"}> David Hestenes
              ,
              = succeed "." do
                %em Space-time Algebra
