          %p Other accounts:
          %ul
            %li#Doran94
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chris+Doran"}> Chris Doran
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Geometric Algebra and its Application to Mathematical Physics
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://geometry.mrao.cam.ac.uk/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/DoranThesis.pdf"} pdf
            %li#Sobczyk13
              %p
                Garrett Sobczyk,
                = succeed "." do
                  %em New Foundations in Mathematics: The Geometric Concept of Number
          %p
            A textbook on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mechanics"} mechanics
            written in this style is
          %ul
